Advance an idle IOP clock to its next real event instead of polling every EE cycle report.
The horizon covers thread wakes, timers, DMA, callbacks and SPU2, is capped at 1 ms for audio,
and is cleared by every EE-side entry point; PS2N_IOP_IDLE_SYNC=1 restores per-report polling.

